        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A cotton round rug is a 60 cm disc worked outward in double crochet from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "magic ring",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in chunky cotton. The same spiral increase as a placemat but on a 6 mm hook. Chunky cotton gives a firm, padded rug suitable for a bathroom floor or beside a bed. Two 200 m balls cover a 60 cm mat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
